## A place to bring everything together

This portfolio brings an introduction, a personal timeline, writing and selected work into one website.

## Content without a database

Blog posts and projects live in Markdoc files. The About section and site settings use JSON. Keystatic provides an editing interface for these files.

## Interaction

The opening scene uses a scroll-driven transition. Later sections use simpler reveals so that browsing stays predictable. The layout also supports reduced motion and ordinary document flow without JavaScript.

